  "adaptations": [
    "Crossterm input is delivered to one synchronous Ratatui owner, so returning from ReviewApp::handle_key is the native consume-and-stop-propagation boundary.",
    "Live state is read directly from ReviewApp and its extension runtime mutex on every event; React callback refs are unnecessary but their no-stale-capture semantics are preserved.",
    "Workdeck additionally recognizes the terminal Menu key and Alt+E as menu toggles. They use the same precedence as Hunk's F10 and remain suppressed while a note draft or modal dialog owns input."
